        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>CD4-positive, CD25-positive, alpha-beta regulatory T-cell</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>CD4-positive, CD25-positive, alpha-beta regulatory T-lymphocyte</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl#cellxgene_subset"/>
        <rdfs:comment>This cell type is compatible with the HIPC Lyoplate markers for &apos;Treg&apos;.  The inclusion of CD127lo in the logical definition is compatible with both human and mouse T cells of this subtype.</rdfs:comment>
