        <rdfs:comment>This cell type is compatible with the HIPC Lyoplate markers for &apos;plasmablast&apos;. Plasmablasts are also reportedly CD48-positive, CD63-positive, CD229-positive, CD270-positive, CD319-positive, CD352-positive, CD361-positive, and IgD-negative.</rdfs:comment>
