        <rdfs:comment>This cell type is compatible with the HIPC Lyoplate markers for &apos;monocyte&apos;. Note that while CD14 is considered a reliable marker for human monocytes, it is only expressed on approximately 85% of mouse monocytes.</rdfs:comment>
