        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl#cellxgene_subset"/>
        <rdfs:comment>This cell type is compatible with the HIPC Lyoplate markers for &apos;CD16+ monocyte&apos;. Markers are associated with human cells. Note that this cell type encompasses both human intermediate monocytes (CD14+, CD16-low), and human non-classical monocytes (CD14-low, CD16+).</rdfs:comment>
