        <rdfs:comment>Observed in mice. There is growing evidence that molecular markers characterizing double negative thymocytes are different across species, especially in mouse versus human thymus. If in doubt, please consider using CL:0002489 &apos;double negative thymocyte&apos;.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>DN2b thymocyte</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
