        <obo:IAO_0000115>A skeletal muscle satellite cell that divides by stem cell division.  A proportion of this population undergoes symmetric stem cell division, producing two skeletal muscle satellite stem cells. The rest undergo asymmetric stem cell division - retaining their identity while budding off a daughter cell that differentiates into an adult skeletal muscle myoblast.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl#cellxgene_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label>skeletal muscle satellite stem cell</rdfs:label>
