        <owl:annotatedTarget>A columnar neuron that is intrinsic to the medulla, connecting distal and proximal layers (Fischbach and Dittrich, 1989; Kind et al., 2021). It has its soma in the cell body rind of the medulla (Fischbach and Dittrich, 1989).</owl:annotatedTarget>
