    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003823 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003823">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003817"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00013789"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00049542"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00058208"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000028>TmY5a</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Transmedullary Y narrow field neuron that terminates with both fine and bleb-type arborizations in lobula layers 4, 5 and 6, and in lobula plate layer 3, but only has fine arborizations in lobula plate layer 1. It displays both fine and bleb-type arborizations in medulla layers M6 and M8, and has fine arborizations in medulla layers M2, M3, M4, M5 and M9 (Morante and Desplan, 2008; Fischbach and Dittrich (1989). It is glutamatergic (Davis et al., 2020).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBrain_NDB:10174</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>VFB:FBbt_00003823</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>TmY5a</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>fly_anatomy.ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>FBbt:00003823</oboInOwl:id>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#cur"/>
        <rdfs:comment>The identification of axons was done using a UAS-tau (P{UAS-tau-lacZ.O} - FBtp0010033) reporter (Morante and Desplan, 2008). The morphology of terminals was judged from figures in Fischbach and Dittrich (1989) as assessed by FlyBrain Neuron DB.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>transmedullary Y neuron TmY5a</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003823"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000028"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>TmY5a</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0247762</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
