        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00059276"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Adult sensory neuron that innervates the labellum. It fasciculates with the adult labial nerve and projects to the subesophageal zone (Nayak and Singh, 1985; Miyazaki and Ito, 2010). There are around 195 of these cells on each side (Nayak and Singh, 1985).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>VFB:FBbt_00004029</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>fly_anatomy.ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
