        <obo:IAO_0000115>Male germ cells of the 16-cell cyst from the end of the S-phase that precedes meiosis I to the end of meiosis I. This S-phase occurs very early in the 16-cell cyst stage so almost all 16 cell cysts are at the primary spermatocyte stage.</obo:IAO_0000115>
