        <obo:IAO_0000028>ORN_VL1</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Adult olfactory receptor neuron that expresses the Ionotropic receptor (Ir) 75d (FBgn0036829) (Silbering et al., 2011). There are three subclasses, which all innervate only the ipsilateral antennal lobe glomerulus VL1 with dendrites transducing signals from the different antennal coeloconic sensilla (Silbering et al., 2011; Kaur et al., 2019).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705"/>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-02-18T11:15:46Z</terms:date>
