        <oboInOwl:id>FBbt:00047835</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Can be identified by expression of zfh1 and distinguishable from follicle stem cells by the lack of Wnt4 expression (Rust et al., 2020).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>prefollicle cell</rdfs:label>
