        <obo:IAO_0000115>Labellar taste bristle that is innervated by a neuron that expresses bitter receptors and responds to bitter stimuli (Weiss et al., 2011). This includes all I-type sensilla and most S-type sensilla (Weiss et al., 2011; Jaeger et al., 2018).</obo:IAO_0000115>
