        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>fly_anatomy.ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>FBbt:00049501</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Cells additionally projecting into the medulla are mentioned, but not shown in images or diagram, by Kremer et al. (2017). Not clear if these should fall under this class - part_of may need revising - https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>adult lobula complex astrocyte-like glial cell</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
