        <obo:IAO_0000115>Columnar epithelial cell of the adult salivary gland responsible for producing and secreting the saliva (Andrew et al., 2000). It expresses the salivary gland-specific transcription factor sage (Fox et al., 2013).</obo:IAO_0000115>
