        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any cell of the male reproductive system that contributes to the production and secretion of seminal fluid proteins. This includes cells of the accessory glands as well as cells of the seminal vesicles and the ejaculatory bulb (Suarez and Wolfner, 2017).</obo:IAO_0000115>
