        <obo:IAO_0000115>Glial cell that makes up the layer of optic-lobe-associated cortex glia. It is located underneath the subperineurial glial sheath, closest to the neuroepithelium in third instar larva and adults.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092"/>
