        <owl:annotatedTarget>Any portion of the organ that covers that body and consists of a layer of epidermis and a layer of dermis.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Skin</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
