        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>A thin but tough extraembryonic membrane of reptiles, birds and mammals that lines the chorion and contains the fEtus and the amniotic fluid around it. [Biology_Online][VHOG]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000003>Structures homologous to the four extraembryonic membranes of reptiles and birds appear in mammals: amnion, chorion, yolk sac, and allantois.[well established][VHOG]</obo:UBPROP_0000003>
