        <obo:IAO_0000115>Area of uterine endometrium found between the implanted chorionic vesicle and the myometrium.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000011>As the embryo enlarges, the decidua capsularis becomes stretched and smooth. Eventually the decidua capsularis merges with the decidua parietalis, obliterating the uterine cavity</obo:UBPROP_0000011>
