        <owl:annotatedTarget>Hollow epithelial tube on dorsal side of the embryo that develops into the central nervous system.[AAO]</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:date_retrieved>2012-06-20</oboInOwl:date_retrieved>
