        <owl:annotatedTarget>Muscle, composed of long cylindrical, multinucleated cells that attaches to the skeleton via tendons.[TAO]</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:date_retrieved>2012-08-14</oboInOwl:date_retrieved>
