        <oboInOwl:ontology>VHOG</oboInOwl:ontology>
        <oboInOwl:source>PMID:10368962 Oota S, Saitou N, Phylogenetic relationship of muscle tissues deduced from superimposition of gene trees. Mol Biol Evol (1999)</oboInOwl:source>
        <oboInOwl:source>http://bgee.unil.ch/</oboInOwl:source>
