        <owl:annotatedTarget>The orifice which allows the passage from the stomach into the intestine. [Dorian_AF, Elsevier&apos;s_encyclopaedic_dictionary_of_medicine, Part_B:_Anatomy_(1988)_Amsterdam_etc.:_Elsevier][VHOG]</owl:annotatedTarget>
