        <owl:annotatedTarget>Anatomical cavity bounded by visceral and parietal peritoneum.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Peritoneal_cavity</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
