            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Conic projection from the posterior edge of the middle of the soft palate, composed of connective tissue containing a number of racemose glands, and some muscular fibers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>In a study of eight mammals a small underdeveloped uvula was found only in baboons</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
