        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000001"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A tuft of capillaries that project into the ventricles of the brain and secretes cerebral spinal fluid. The choroid plexus is covered by a cuboidal epithelium which maintains the integrity of the blood-brain barrier.[TAO]</owl:annotatedTarget>
