        <oboInOwl:source>DOI:10.1038/35054550 Murphy WJ, Eizirik E, Johnson WE, Zhang YP, Ryder OA, O&apos;Brien SJ, Molecular phylogenetics and the origins of placental mammals. Nature (2001)</oboInOwl:source>
