        <oboInOwl:source>DOI:10.1016/j.autneu.2010.03.002 Young HM, Cane KN, Anderson CR, Development of the autonomic nervous system: A comparative view. Autonomic Neuroscience : basic and clinical (2010)</oboInOwl:source>
        <oboInOwl:source>http://bgee.unil.ch/</oboInOwl:source>
    </owl:Axiom>
