        <obo:IAO_0000115>The thin membranous structure between the two heart atria or the thick muscular structure between the two heart ventricles.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>&apos;Terrestrial vertebrates have divided hearts in which septae separate the oxygenated and deoxygenated blood within the pulmonary and systemic circulations&apos;</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>in GO, septum morphogenesis is part of cardiac chamber morphogenesis; need to add axioms to infer this</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
