        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>note that this corresponds to FMA:&apos;free lower limb&apos; (a limb segment), NOT &apos;lower limb&apos;. Both MA and FMA consider shoulder (and shoulder bones) part of upper limb. Note that AAO class probably refers to skeleton</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
