        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>heart epicardium</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>visceral serous pericardium of heart</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>visceral serous pericardium proper</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>uberon</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
