        <rdfs:comment>EDITOR_NOTE TODO - check links with UBERON:0002425 visceral serous pericardium. develops from proepicardium. WP:Epicardium -- When considered as a part of the pericardium, it is the inner layer, or visceral pericardium, continuous with the serous layer.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>epicardium</rdfs:label>
