        <owl:annotatedTarget>An area of conducting tissue between the atria and the ventricles of the heart that conducts the normal electrical impulse from the atria to the ventricles.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>UBERON:cjm</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
