        <obo:RO_0002171 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0003040"/>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>Region of the mesencephalon that arises from a small area of the neural plate, spanning the midline immediately adjacent, and being slightly posterior to the dorsal tegmentum area[XAO:0004226, PMID:2351962].</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
