        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000011"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>originate from the somitomeres. These muscles develop late and are not complete even at birth. Tongue muscles develop before masticatory muscles and complete by birth</owl:annotatedTarget>
