        <owl:annotatedTarget>FMA draws the distinction between e.g. &apos;fourth ventricle&apos; and &apos;cavity of fourth ventricle&apos;. The latter is a cavity, and part of the former, which is a region. The superclass of &apos;fourth ventricle&apos; is_a &apos;region of ventricular system of the brain&apos;. We place this class here, although it is not equivalent to ventricles, as it includes ventricle bodies.</owl:annotatedTarget>
