        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>subventricular zone</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>subventricular zone of brain</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>uberon</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
