        <owl:annotatedTarget>A paired brain structure situated throughout the lateral walls of the lateral ventricles. It has been associated with having four distinct layers of variable thickness and cell density, as well as cellular composition[WP][Wikipedia:Subventricular_zone].</owl:annotatedTarget>
