            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cluster of neurons that is the most prominent longitudinally extending condensed part of a nervous system.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>some species have multiple longitudinal nerve cords; this class refers to the most prominent one, which is dorsal in chordates and ventral in others.</obo:IAO_0000232>
