        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000012"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>in MA classified as part of insular cortex, but this is contested by MM - https://support.crbs.ucsd.edu/browse/NIF-9830</owl:annotatedTarget>
