        <obo:IAO_0000115>A division of the stomach. The stomach can be divided based on mucosal histology (glandular epithelium and gastric glands) and the relative position and type of gastric gland.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>We follow Kardong in defining stomach regions by gland, but we also include &apos;body of stomach&apos;. In future we may want to have different partitions of the stomach</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>UBERON:0009034</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EMAPA:35821</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FMA:14558</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>MA:0002561</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:245415005</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Stomach#Sections</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>gastric zone</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>region of stomach</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>section of stomach</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>uberon</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>UBERON:0009870</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>zone of stomach</rdfs:label>
        <foaf:depiction rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/Regions_of_stomach.svg</foaf:depiction>
    </owl:Class>
