            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A retractable double-layered fold of skin and mucous membrane that covers the glans penis or clitoris. Glands may also be present.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>this is a generic sex-neutral grouping class for the male and female prepuce. Note that this structure is a combination of skin and other tissue</obo:IAO_0000232>
